  "observations": [
    "The B.Cu view shows the retained POWER_READY branches from P_J22 toward P_R204 and the inner-layer transition; adjacent In6 ground now covers their trace lengths outside the plated connector-pad clearances.",
    "The In3 trace is covered by the extended In4 ground field. The native contact audit confirms P_J22 pin 2 and the existing transition return via contact both In4 and In6 main ground.",
    "Non-ground plated pads retain clearance rings, and the local In6 ground-zone boundary remains visibly separated. Quantitative native geometry, group and reference checks provide the acceptance evidence.",
